title: Records reference each other by path
kind: Decision
date: 2026-11-10
team: contents/team/platform.team
project: contents/project/record-model.project
milestone: contents/milestone/five-record-types.milestone
issues:
  - contents/issue/share-reference-definitions.issue
attendees:
  - dave
  - erin
body: |
  A reference is the project-relative path of the target record.
  Each schema publishes its own path pattern in $defs/ref; other schemas reuse it with $ref.
  References point upward only: note -> issue -> milestone -> project -> team.
